a python wrapper of &lt;a href="http://diffeq.sciml.ai/dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DifferentialEquations.jl&lt;/a> and scipy built-in ode solver
for its core routines to give high performance solving of large stiff differential equations, currently
including:&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>N-linked Gycosylation Simulation in Perfusion Bioreactor&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Raman Spectrometry and Raman Data Analytics&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Plantwise Simulation (Cell Culture and Chromatography)&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
