&lt;p>The end goal of this project is to build a modularized platform, composed of an interactive interface and a digital twin based “vLab”. The digital twin is designed to simulate end-to-end bioprocess by using state-of-the-art mechanistic models for prediction, control and risk management.&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>